    "\n",
    "### What and why\n",
    "The checkpoint is **16 of 20 on the held-out set**, i.e. 80%. This section is a loop: read the mistakes, change **one thing** in `system.md` or `user.j2`, save, re-run, and see what moved. You do not change any code.\n",
