    "## 11. Commit, and run the checkpoint\n",
    "\n",
    "### What and why\n",
    "Your files count once they are on GitHub, and your score counts once the checkpoint test has re-measured it. Two steps, in two different repositories: mixing them up is the most common slip of the day.\n",
