    "   prompts/support_classifier/user.j2                                   runs the 20 held-out tickets\n",
    "   experiments/s16_heldout.md                                           live, needs at least 16 right\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### The commands\n",
    "In PowerShell, in your **work** repository (not the course repository):\n",
    "\n",
    "```powershell\n",
    "cd ~\\Documents\\genai-course-work\n",
    "git add prompts experiments\n",
    "git commit -m \"Session 16: structured classifier, held-out report\"\n",
    "git push\n",
    "```\n",
    "1. **`git add prompts experiments`** stages both folders, so all three files go into the commit.\n",
    "2. **`git commit -m \"...\"`** records them with a message that says what changed.\n",
